<body>
<div class="wrap">

<div class="card">
    <h1>Standings Timeline Lite — Visual Alignment</h1>
    <p>Presentation-only migration for Weekly Standings + Timeline Lite.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h2>Preflight</h2>
    <table>
        <?php preflight_row('Exact weekly_standings.php v066 baseline', $weeklyBaselineOk, $weeklyCurrentHash); ?>
        <?php preflight_row('Exact standings_timeline_lite.php v002 baseline', $liteBaselineOk, $liteCurrentHash); ?>
        <?php preflight_row('standings_timeline.php dependency present', $timelineReferenceOk, $timelineBeforeHash); ?>
        <?php preflight_row('Complete weekly_standings.php v067 replacement embedded', $weeklyReplacementOk, WEEKLY_NEW_SHA256); ?>
        <?php preflight_row('Complete standings_timeline_lite.php v003 replacement embedded', $liteReplacementOk, LITE_NEW_SHA256); ?>
    </table>
</div>

<?php if ($preflightOk): ?>
<div class="card">
    <h2>What this changes</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Weekly Standings: widens the shared Week / Segment / Season score column from 56px to 64px.</li>
        <li>Timeline Lite: keeps Live / Year / Race / &lt;&lt; / &gt;&gt; behavior unchanged.</li>
        <li>Timeline Lite: changes the heavy banner to a subdued <strong>Standings as of ...</strong> pill.</li>
        <li>Timeline Lite: adds the approved <strong>AUTO-SCORING – UNOFFICIAL</strong> pill.</li>
        <li>Timeline Lite: aligns the four standings tables with Weekly Standings styling and proportions.</li>
        <li>Timeline Lite: adds the unofficial marker to Print output.</li>
        <li>No scoring, reconstruction, snapshot, LP/RD, audit, release-history, DB, or spreadsheet logic is changed.</li>
    </ul>

    <?php if (!$apply): ?>
    <form method="post">
        <input type="hidden" name="apply" value="1">
        <button type="submit">Install Visual Alignment</button>
    </form>
    <?php endif; ?>
</div>
<?php endif; ?>

<?php if ($apply): ?>
<div class="card">
    <h2>Apply Result</h2>
    <p class="<?php echo $success ? 'ok' : 'bad'; ?>"><strong><?php echo $success ? 'SUCCESS' : 'FAILED / ROLLED BACK'; ?></strong></p>
    <ul>
        <?php foreach ($messages as $message): ?>
            <li><?php echo ih($message); ?></li>
        <?php endforeach; ?>
    </ul>

    <?php if ($success): ?>
        <p><a href="/race_results/weekly_standings.php" target="_blank">Open Weekly Standings v067</a></p>
        <p><a href="/race_results/standings_timeline_lite.php" target="_blank">Open Timeline Lite v003</a></p>
    <?php endif; ?>
</div>
<?php endif; ?>

</div>
